== Effect ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that drops a {{e|Penny|text=coin}} every 2 [[rooms]].
** The first drop happens after 1 room.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Sack of Pennies having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: The familiar drops coins in a repeating pattern of 1, 2, 2 then 2 rooms.

